<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμ-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>falling into</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				22
			</span></i>: generally, <i>falling</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπῶν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				7.186
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>falling upon, pressure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>incidence, impact</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰδώλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				2.3.2
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἡλίου εἰς τὰ νέφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					3.2.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>propensity</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					1.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>reduction</i> of dislocation, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).325
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>inundation</i> of the Nile, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.Astr.
				1.21
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
